c = Path("docs/SOURCE_CANDIDATES.md"); x = c.read_text(); i = x.find("| lists collected 21 Nov (302 items")
new = "| TESTED 21 Nov (TRACK 3.84-3.85): negative reports come with a fall of about 4.4% on the day (passes), larger when the allegation is more serious; for reports out before the open the fall is over by the open and the share then bounces; no tradable rule; Hindenburg closed Jan 2025. Qualify as live ALERTS (no rule): Grizzly, Blue Orca, Fuzzy Panda, Hunterbrook -- founder's decision. Lead to confirm forward: reports out during the session, next session. |"
